WEBVTT

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:10.160
So, I [music] am flying to New York City

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:14.000
today to have a meeting that could

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:16.400
change [music] the rest of my life.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.880
Today, I might be selling my company,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.359
Starter Story, for a life-changing

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.439
amount of money. It feels crazy [music]

00:00:21.359 --> 00:00:25.039
right now, and I don't really know

00:00:23.439 --> 00:00:30.039
exactly how to feel about it. So, I

00:00:25.039 --> 00:00:30.039
figured let's document it.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.680
So almost 10 years ago, I moved to New

00:00:40.079 --> 00:00:46.399
York City for a job. I had no idea I was

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:50.079
going to build a business, but I know I

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:52.719
did want one thing, something more. So

00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:54.320
now I'm flying back to New York City to

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.440
sell this thing that I built and

00:00:54.320 --> 00:01:01.160
potentially go back to a job. All right,

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:01.160
let's get on this plane.

00:01:06.159 --> 00:01:10.560
>> Okay, so I just landed at JFK. My

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.320
meeting is in a couple hours. Guess I

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:16.119
got a little time. So, I want to take

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:16.119
