00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.879
what's crazy is that quitting and

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:46.720
freedom, I thought that was the goal,

00:03:42.879 --> 00:03:49.519
but it was really just the beginning.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:51.120
So, my name is Pat Walls and I work on

00:03:49.519 --> 00:03:54.319
starterstory.com.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:56.640
When I quit my job, I had about $12,000

00:03:54.319 --> 00:04:00.159
to my name. That was it. The only thing

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:03.280
that I could do was go allin. And for a

00:04:00.159 --> 00:04:06.400
