00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:20.880
shipping, posting content, interviewing,

00:04:16.959 --> 00:04:24.479
coding, refreshing Stripe over and over

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:28.479
and over. It never exploded overnight.

00:04:24.479 --> 00:04:30.880
It just accumulated and slowly people

00:04:28.479 --> 00:04:33.138
started to notice. Revenue started

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:35.600
ticking up. I hired my first person

00:04:33.138 --> 00:04:37.680
[music] who was actually my sister and

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:40.000
that was the first moment that things

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:43.360
started to feel [music] real.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.600
Then another hire, then another. It

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:48.560
