00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:52.560
it started feeling like a real company.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:55.120
And with that came more money, but also

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:57.919
more responsibility.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:05:00.000
Man, going back to all those places,

00:04:57.919 --> 00:05:02.639
remembering the whole journey of how I

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.000
got here was an absolute trip. You know

00:05:02.639 --> 00:05:07.520
what I started thinking about a little

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:11.039
bit was why I started this business. It

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:14.000
was for freedom. And in so many ways, I

00:05:11.039 --> 00:05:15.440
got that. I achieved it. No boss,

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.919
freedom of my time to [music] do

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:20.639
anything I wanted at any time. But then

00:05:17.919 --> 00:05:22.560
over the years, something changed. As

00:05:20.639 --> 00:05:25.520
the business grew and it became

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:28.158
successful, it all of a sudden became my

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:30.320
identity. I wasn't just Pat anymore.

00:05:28.158 --> 00:05:32.560
[music] I was the starter story guy. And

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:35.039
