00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:42.400
life was dedicated to building this

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.479
business and making sure everything was

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.240
growing and everything was perfect. If

00:05:44.479 --> 00:05:48.560
