00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:29.599
If I really want this thing to grow

00:07:25.919 --> 00:07:31.599
beyond me, then I have to let it go. So

00:07:29.599 --> 00:07:33.680
in that [music] moment, all of a sudden,

00:07:31.599 --> 00:07:36.560
it didn't feel like signing my life

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:39.280
